{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:de8adcbfd5d4fbf0e4a44fbe7d346d98d23509e53a86b8dbe260186f262e5075",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56c6faa1734a4e20a621fbc9bfc677331c76d5eecafce5e189ab4d09bcb0de2f",
      "text": "既然乐队成员5个人都到齐了，\n今天我想讨论一下今后的方针！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:423666962f33b83c992a7a81cf329eb7eb7ef3ea22390094d934a18d5a0469b3",
      "text": "（……哇啊。\n自己说出来，感觉超有模有样的……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4733ae842e7eaf7ba4bcb393e181c08c318c95bf364393856550bdf8e216c860",
      "text": "（很有组乐队挥洒青春的感觉……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93c72a3f01718703615179b244bed232dece0440be13b04fa4841c9b1978420",
      "text": "既然是乐队，果然还是得开演唱会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34c7c60312c46e7c65550dca43aff893d52cee6d15b2685a79fafa6de3e6ff78",
      "text": "……也得，写歌呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f43f275c86b9eb77a0a1bc3f523fc5d9028ef40c4a9f1ef0c99fb8d3cc33db7",
      "text": "还有就是，希望能让更多的人\n听到我们的歌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d81397212ab11a52e8c93aa462b7f778594b2b9fa1da3b3b818f163f6dce6f7",
      "text": "那那那，街头路演怎么样！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ace6d0b05724c285d3bb2681009da86e47b01ab192f9fb150277118b9240369f",
      "text": "从街头开始的成名之路……！\n这种设定，简直帅到炸裂啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716017d9c287e8347a616e968957dc2ac6719db7d06ba6ef6bb602de9942a701",
      "text": "不错嘛！\n要是街头路演的话，我们应该马上就能办了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0aa78ac9778e42090985961cb82262a074272ee91e55a68a3062ed453614c098",
      "text": "事情可没那么简单。\n街头路演需要办理各种手续和许可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3de641dda0d8428237cca6724f654b45c4cf7502dc50e944e2714a5a52914a7",
      "text": "手续办起来很麻烦，而且……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a19055217e1af161feb2b8554f6a609be4363657f22a876fb044e7bb0a297140",
      "text": "总之！我反对街头路演。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_02_1_1_008_02:1_1_008_02_c:cmd-000157:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb26929a157eba2608a344f968d52439c7374f8d2c2bce38cd4542f0b1aaf467",
      "text": "那，这种怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
